SUMMARY: Beginner Square Dance Party – No Partner Needed!
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\n**Try Something Ne
 w\, Something Fun! Attend the Square Dance Party!**\nEver thought *“I wa
 nt to try something new\, something fun”*? Square dancing in Raleigh is 
 social\, active\, and surprisingly easy — even if you’ve never danced 
 before. Join **Capital Squares** for **a square dance party night** on **T
 uesday\, August 18\, 2026**\, and discover the fun!\n\n🕺 **What to Expe
 ct**\n\n* Beginner-friendly instruction — **no experience needed**\n* Ge
 ntle\, fun movement that keeps your brain and body engaged\n* Friendly\, w
 elcoming group — no partner required\n* Plenty of laughs and small victo
 ries\n* Dancing to a variety of familiar music styles\n* Meet new friends 
 — people from all walks of life come to dance.\n\n👥 **Who This Is Per
 fect For**\n\n* Absolute beginners curious about square dancing\n* Anyone 
 seeking a social\, low-pressure activity\n* People looking for a fresh\, f
 un hobby\n* Solo attendees — most people come alone\n\n🤍 **For Nervou
 s First-Timers**\nYou **don’t need to be coordinated or confident**. The
  first night is low-pressure\, paced for beginners\, and designed to be fu
 n from the start. Many who felt nervous walked out smiling — ready for t
 he next week.\n\n💬 **What First-Timers Say**\n*"I thought I’d feel aw
 kward\, but I laughed the whole time and actually learned something!"*\n*"
 I came alone\, but everyone was so friendly — I can’t wait for the nex
 t week."*\n\n📅 **Event Details**\n\n* **Date:** Tuesday\, August 18\, 2
 026\n* **Time:** 7–9 PM\n* **Location:** St. James United Methodist Chur
 ch\n* **Cost:** $10 for a night of fun and entertainment\n* **Eventbrite T
 ickets:** [https://www.eventbrite.com/e/1995449757942](https://www.eventbr
 ite.com/e/1995449757942)\n\n⚠️ **Only 40 spots for new dancers!**\n\n
 👉 **Grab your spot now!**\n\n**Questions?**\nContact Eva Murray: 919-92
 6-8095 or visit [https://CapitalSquares.org/learn](https://CapitalSquares.
 org/learn)
